{"type":"message","id":"98f582ce","parentId":"d295126a","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:29:29.652Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"速率限制很严重。让我基于目前已有的信息来分析和决定哪些技能值得安装。\n\n根据已获取的信息，让我筛选出有价值的技能：\n\n**已发现但未安装的技能（基于相关性评分 > 3.0）：**\n\n**Feishu 相关（对方总日常工作重要）：**\n1. feishu-doc-manager (3.603) - 飞书文档管理器\n2. feishu-bridge (3.585) - Feishu Bridge\n3. feishu-messaging (3.583) - Feishu 消息\n4. feishu-leave-request (3.501) - 请假申请\n5. feishu-bitable (3.499) - 多维表格\n6. feishu-card (3.482) - 飞书卡片\n7. feishu-sheets-skill (3.473) - 飞书表格\n8. feishu-file-sender (3.467) - 文件发送\n9. feishu-memory-recall (3.464) - 记忆召回\n10. skill-feishu-manager (3.457) - Feishu 管理器\n11. feishu-meeting (3.269) - 飞书会议\n12. schedule-feishu (3.299) - 飞书日程\n\n**Automation 相关：**\n1. ai-web-automation (3.588) - AI 网页自动化\n2. x-post-automation (3.544) - X/Twitter 发帖自动化\n3. activecampaign-automation (3.481) - ActiveCampaign 自动化\n4. afrexai-business-automation (3.468) - 商业自动化\n5. agentic-workflow-automation (3.454) - 智能体工作流自动化\n\n\n6. data-automation-service (3.415) - 数据自动化服务\n\n**Productivity 相关：**\n1. afrexai-productivity-system (3.340) - 生产力操作系统\n2. ai-productivity-audit (3.316) - AI 生产力审计\n\n**Meeting 相关：**\n1. ai-meeting-prep (3.373) - 会议准备\n2. meeting-prep-agent (3.371) - 会议准备智能体\n3. meeting-notes-pro (3.350) - 专业会议笔记\n4. afrexai-meeting-mastery (3.339) - 会议精通\n\n由于 ClawHub 存在速率限制，我无法查看下载量和更新时间等详细信息。根据方总的实际需求（中智科仪CEO，使用飞书进行工作协作），应该优先考虑安装 Feishu 相关技能。不过，既然已经配置了 feishu-doc、feishu-wiki、feishu-drive、feishu-bitable 等内置技能，这些很可能已经满足了他的主要需求。\n\n检查已安装的技能清单后发现，只有 lark-calendar 这一个飞书相关的独立技能。基于相关性评分，最值得安装的候选包括：feishu-doc-manager 作为飞书文档管理器，feishu-bridge 用于连接 Feishu Bridge，feishu-messaging 处理 Feishu 消息功能，feishu-bitable 管理飞书多维表格，以及 schedule-feishu 来同步飞书日程。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"速率限制严重，让我基于已有信息进行筛选并尝试安装高价值技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_afde09b362fe415b827993ac","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install feishu-doc-manager --no-input 2>&1 || echo \"Install skipped\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_031a4ebf95fa4b83af3f5c30","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install feishu-bitable --no-input 2>&1 || echo \"Install skipped\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_e2d367160023463a9d5951d9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install schedule-feishu --no-input 2>&1 || echo \"Install skipped\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":739,"output":835,"cacheRead":20032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21606,"cost":{"input":0.000739,"output":0.0026720000000000003,"cacheRead":0.0040064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007417400000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773361744307}}
