ocument-pro, productivity, meeting-prep, apple-notes, task, calendar, gog, find-skills, obsidian, flomo-notes, summarize, self-improving-agent, things-mac, email-to-calendar, trello, document-summary, gcalcli-calendar, humanizer, proactive-agent, todoist, schedule, nano-pdf, humanize-ai-text, multi-search-engine, meeting-to-action, peekaboo, bear-notes, coordinate-meeting, macos-calendar, meeting-autopilot-pro, brave-search, youtube-watcher, byterover, clean-content-fetch, turing-pyramid, skill-vetter, openclaw-optimizer, accli, lark-calendar, outlook, email-best-practices, auto-updater, api-gateway\n\n## 遇到的问题\n\n1. **ClawHub API 速率限制** - 多次搜索和安装请求被拒绝\n2. **安全警告** - 以下技能被 VirusTotal Code Insight 标记为可疑：\n   - feishu-doc-manager\n   - schedule-feishu\n   \n## 建议\n\n1. **等待后重试** - 建议间隔 1 小时后再次尝试安装：\n   - feishu-bitable（飞书多维表格）\n   - agentic-workflow-automation（智能体工作流自动化）\n   - meeting-notes-pro（专业会议笔记）\n\n2. **安全审查** - 对标记为可疑的技能进行代码审查后再决定是否安装\n\n3. **内置技能优先** - 当前 OpenClaw 已内置 feishu-doc、feishu-bitable 等技能，基本满足方总的飞书协作需求\n\n## 总结\n\n本次进化任务因 ClawHub API 速率限制未能完成新技能安装。已发现多个高价值技能，建议在下次执行时优先安装：\n- feishu-bitable（增强飞书多维表格能力）\n- agentic-workflow-automation（增强自动化工作流）\n- meeting-notes-pro（增强会议笔记能力）\n\n当前技能库已较为完善，涵盖日历、任务、文档、会议、邮件、笔记等核心场景。\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":271,"output":1165,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23196,"cost":{"input":0.000271,"output":0.0037280000000000004,"cacheRead":0.004352,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.008351}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773361803558}}
